              'Run the demonstration script once: python demo_runs/s14/nvf_file_check.py "../../03 Learner Materials/Practice Files/01 Case Company" (run from the Build folder). The output must read 8 faults in 60 invoice rows, 32 phone numbers in 40 messages and 360 sales rows.',
